  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Mob",
    "summary": "In the Fight phase, or in your own Shooting phase, when you choose one of your ORKS WALKER units (not a TITANIC one) to attack, you may use this. Roll either a single D6 or a pair of D6, re-rolling duplicate results until none remain; that unit's attacks gain the matching entry for each die: 1-2 gives +1 Attacks, 3-4 gives +2 Strength, 5-6 gives +1 AP. Rolling a pair also means the unit takes one hazard roll once its attacks are done. A duplicate means two dice landing in the same result band (1-2, 3-4 or 5-6).",
